                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00014         *   2      2012/01/05  Robert Gault
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00015         * Converted raw reads of $FFA0-$FFAF to a routine that gets images
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00016         * from the system. Now works with 2 or 8Meg systems. Unfortunately
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00017         * it was necessary to make buffers within the code rather than data
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00018         * area because it was safer given data was shared with other modules.
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00019         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00020         * Simplified some other routines.
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00021         *
