0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00069         V.Msk2              RMB       1                   mask byte 2 (00,55,AA,FF) Full byte Color Mask
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00070         V.MCol              RMB       1                   Start pixel in a byte mask ($C0=4 color, $80=2 color)
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00071         V.4A                RMB       1                   End pixel in a byte mask ($03=4 color,$01=2 color)
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00072         V.PMask             RMB       1                   Full byte pixel mask for colors (i.e. $55, $CC etc)
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00073         V.4C                RMB       1
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00074         V.4D                RMB       1
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00075         V.4E                RMB       1                   Flood Fill full byte color mask
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00076         V.4F                RMB       1
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00077         V.Caps              RMB       1                   caps lock info: $00=lower $FF=upper
