0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00079         V.KyDly             RMB       1                   key repeat initial delay
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00080         V.KySpd             RMB       1                   key repeat secondary delay
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00081         V.WrChr             RMB       1                   character to write
