001B                  (       cocovtio.d):00877         Wt.MaxX             RMB       2                   Maximum X cord. (0-79,0-639)                 $1B
001D                  (       cocovtio.d):00878         Wt.MaxY             RMB       2                   Maximum Y cord. (0-24/25,0-191/199)          $1D
001F                  (       cocovtio.d):00879         Wt.BLen             RMB       2                   bytes left in GPLoad block below             $1F
0021                  (       cocovtio.d):00880         Wt.NBlk             RMB       1                   memory block # for next GPLoad               $21
0022                  (       cocovtio.d):00881         Wt.NOff             RMB       2                   Offset in block for next GPLoad              $22
0024                  (       cocovtio.d):00882         Wt.LStDf            RMB       2                   screen logical start default                 $24
                      (       cocovtio.d):00883         * NOTE: The following default settings are what the window was initialized
                      (       cocovtio.d):00884         *       with, and thus are the MAXIMUM start/size the window can handle
                      (       cocovtio.d):00885         *       until it is restarted (DWEnd & DWSet)
                      (       cocovtio.d):00886         *       They also appear to be used in WindInt to determine the coords &
                      (       cocovtio.d):00887         *       sizes for control+content regions
0026                  (       cocovtio.d):00888         Wt.DfCPX            RMB       1                   default X cord. start                        $26
