                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00576         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00577         *  Set up screens
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00578         *  SetStat Function Code $8B
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00579         *          Allocates and maps high res screen
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00580         *          into application address space
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00581         * entry:
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00582         *       a -> path number
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00583         *       b -> function code $8B (SS.AScrn)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00584         *       x -> screen type
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00585         *            0 = 640 x 192 x 2 colors (16K)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00586         *            1 = 320 x 192 x 4 colors (16K)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00587         *            2 = 160 x 192 x 16 colors (16K)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00588         *            3 = 640 x 192 x 4 colors (32K)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00589         *            4 = 320 x 192 x 16 colors (32K)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00590         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00591         * exit:
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00592         *       x -> application address space of screen
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00593         *       y -> screen number (1-3)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00594         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00595         * error:
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00596         *       CC -> Carry set on error
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00597         *       b  -> error code (if any)
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00598         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00599         *  Call use VDGINT allocates high res graphics for use with screens
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00600         *  updated by the process, does not clear the screens only allocates
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00601         *  See OS-9 Technical Reference 8-142 for more details
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00602         *
                      (./objs/sierra.asm):00603         
